    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transported to another world, your objective now is to survive until dawn in a place filled with hideous creatures, all while being hunted down by the terrifying, Coffinman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>&quot;Coffinman is perfect for fans of indie first-person horror game, survival games, and anyone who loves anything horror. If you enjoy the thrill of navigating unknown, terrifying spaces, completing simple task while avoiding monsters &amp; demons hunting you through all night&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>your only objectives is to survive until dawn while making sure the energy not run out to 0%. To save energy, you need to turn the lights off in every floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596280/extras/63fe783f08def47b5e34080aa3519f39.avif?t=1744385758\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
